"{\n  \"AND\": {\n    \"left\": {\n      \"AND\": {\n        \"left\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Have a CD4 cell count greater than 50 cells/mm3\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"AND\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"or CD4 < 50\"\n                        },\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"and felt that in the best interest of the patient, that enrollment in the study will allow for quicker initiation of antiretroviral therapy than referral to another treatment center.\"\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"Be at least 18 years of age and able to give informed consent.\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"AND\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"Diagnosed with TB by criteria per Brazilian Ministry of Health\"\n                        },\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"and have a good clinical response to TB.\"\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            \"right\": {\n              \"AND\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw_text\": \"Tolerating tuberculosis therapy containing rifampin for the 2 weeks prior to screening,except for persons taking protease inhibitors at time of diagnosis of TB.\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"left\": {\n                      \"raw_text\": \"HIV positive with documentation present in source document.\"\n                    },\n                    \"right\": {\n                      \"AND\": {\n                        \"left\": {\n                          \"raw_text\": \"Have a genotype showing no resistance to Kaletra\"\n                        },\n                        \"right\": {\n                          \"OR\": {\n                            \"left\": {\n                              \"raw_text\": \"Taking Kaletra containing regimen with suppressed viral load.\"\n                            },\n                            \"right\": {\n                              \"AND\": {\n                                \"left\": {\n                                  \"raw_text\": \"Taking an NNRTI or integrase containing regimen without prior history of use of PI for more than 2 weeks\"\n                                },\n                                \"right\": {\n                                  \"OR\": {\n                                    \"left\": {\n                                      \"raw_text\": \"Taking an NNRTI or integrase containing regimen with prior exposure to PI greater than 2 weeks. It must be clearly stated in the source document that PI was switched to another agent for convenience.\"\n                                    },\n                                    \"right\": {\n                                      \"raw_text\": \"Taking another PI containing regimens with suppressed viral load. It must be clearly stated in source document that if another PI was used for greater than 2 weeks the regimen was switched to another agent for convenience.\"\n                                    }\n                                  }\n                                }\n                              }\n                            }\n                          }\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"raw_text\": \"Subjects with prior history of PI use may be enrolled, if there is a genotype showing no resistance to Kaletra.\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"